// Cutscenes
#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Cutscene1_CaptainSaysFarewell
[BLUE]That's as far as I go!\pI do believe the host of the Battle\nFrontier is here today.\pI assume you'll want to see them\nbefore doing anything else.\pCome see me whenever you want to\nferry between Tsarvosa City and\lthe Battle Frontier.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Cutscene2_MortTalksToBroadcaster
[BLUE]Now, make sure you get a wide shot\nof the Battle Sim arena, okay?\pI want to show the world how premier\nour tech is!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Cutscene3_MortSeesPlayer
[BLUE]Well, I'll be! Is that Champion\n[PLAYER], in the flesh?\pCome on over here!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Cutscene3_MortExplainsWhyHeIsThere
[BLUE]Can you believe it?\pLittle ol' Mort being asked to run\nthe Battle Frontier?\pAn honour, truly!\pA shindig this prestigious calls for\nthe best of the best.\pThat's precisely why I called\nupon Kulure's Gym Leaders to help\lme run this place!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Cutscene4_MortOpensRules
[BLUE]Now, I'm sure you're just itching to\nget into it, so I won't keep you\llong.\pThe bigwigs gave me something to\nread to new challengers.\pOne second[.]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Cutscene5_MortFindsTheSummary
[BLUE]Yikes! That is a LOT of text.\nHold on[.]\pOh, there's a summary at the end,\nsweet. I'll just read that.\pAhem!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Cutscene6_MortReadsTheRules
[BLACK]Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\pThis is where the pinnacle of Pok\emon\nbattling happens.\pTrainers from all over the world\nflock here, and you can expect to\lsee Pok\emon and movesets not\lnormally seen in your home region.\pChallenge 8 different facilities to\nprove your mastery over battle.\pEach facility hosts different rules\nthat'll put your skills to the test.\pChallenge Aces and Brains - [BLUE]that's\nthe gym leaders, by the way[BLACK] - at\la streak of 20 and 50 battles\lrespectively.\pEach win earns you\nPokeChips, with the payout growing\levery 10 wins.\pYou get extra PokeChips when an Ace\nor Brain is beaten.\pActive Game Modifiers are disabled\nfor the duration of your challenge\l- [BLUE]whatever that means!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Cutscene7_MortAfterInstructions
[BLUE][.]And that's the gist.\pYou're a smart kid, I'm sure you can\nfigure out the rest on your own.\pIf you ever need a refresher, just\nask the attendant at any facility\land they'll sort you out.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Cutscene8_MortDeparts
[BLUE]Ciao, champ!\pShow me some good battling, yeah?\nIt's good for business.

// NPCs
#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Researcher
Me? No, I don't battle.\pI'm from an institute that studies\nPok\emon battle strategies.\pWe're investigating whether a\nfoolproof strategy exists.\pMaybe we'll watch your battles, too?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_Prompt
I've been watching how fired up the\nyoungsters get here.\pYou could say their passion has\ngotten me fired up too, ohohoho!\pThere is just one problem[.] I am not\na skilled battler. I am rich,\lhowever!\pI will buy any spare Pok\eChips you\nhave for \$2,000 each.\pAre you interested?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_YesToSell
Wonderful! How many will you sell?\n[BLACK](Held: [BUFFER1])[BLUE]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_No
What a pity!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_HaveZeroChips
You don't even have any!\nDo you take me for a rube?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_ChoseZeroChips
Zero Pok\eChips?? My, how stingy!\nMy time is more valuable than this.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_ChoseMoreChipsThanPlayerHas
Do you take me for a fool?\nYou don't have that many!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_YesToConfirmChipsChosen
[BUFFER2]? I can offer you \$[BUFFER3]\nfor that. Are you sure?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_WalletNearlyFull
Ah, hold on - you couldn't carry all\nthat money!\pI'll take [BUFFER2] of them for now and\nyou can keep the rest.\pDo come back once you've spent a\nlittle, won't you?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_WalletFull
My word! Your wallet is bursting at\nthe seams.\pAs much as I'd like to take your\nPok\eChips for free, I have class.\pCome back once you've spent some\ncash and can accept my payment.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokemonCenterOldMan
I've come here to watch my grandson\nbattle.\pI have to be honest. I don't\nunderstand Pok\emon battling.\pBut, it makes my grandson happy and\nI want to support him!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_PokeChipBuyer_SaleCompleted
Very good! Our transaction is\ncomplete.\pI will use these Pok\eChips to tutor\nmy Pok\emon and rise to the top of\lthis "Battle Frontier.\"

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_Intro
Oh! Don't mind me - I'm just between\nshows.\pI used to tour the contest halls in\nHoenn with my little co-star.\pShe adored the costumes, the crowds,\nthe lights[.] All of it!\pBut these days I'm on the road more\nthan I'm on a stage[.]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_OffersPikachu
A performer deserves an audience.\pWould you take her with you?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_DeclinedGift
I understand - she's a handful!\nCome find me if you change your mind.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_NoPartyRoom
Goodness, your team is packed!\pMake a little room for her and come\nback, won't you?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_GivesPikachu
Then she's yours. Go on, say hello!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_PikachuObtained
[PLAYER] received a Cosplay Pikachu\nfrom Belle!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_ExplainsCostumes
Her wardrobe is still packed away in\nmy trunk, of course.\pStop by any time and I'll dress her\nup for whatever role you like.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_CostumePrompt
How is Piki doing?\nShall I change her costume?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_ChoosePikiPrompt
Great! Can I see her, please?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_DeclinedCostume
Another time, then.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_WrongPokemon
[BUFFER1]? Oh dear - nothing in my\ntrunk would fit!\pThese costumes were tailored for Piki\nand Piki alone.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_ChooseCostume
Wonderful! Which role is [BUFFER1]\nplaying today?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_ChoiceEveryday
Everyday

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_ChoiceRockStar
Rock Star

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_ChoiceBelle
Belle

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_ChoicePopStar
Pop Star

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_ChoicePhD
Ph.D.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_ChoiceLibre
Libre

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_CostumeChanging
Hold still[.] there!\nOh, Piki, that's why you're a star!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_CosplayLady_CostumeRemoved
Out of costume and back to yourself.\nEvery star needs a day off!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_MasudaDittoTrader_Intro
I'm just no good at battling.\pI think I'll give up and get into\ncamping instead.\pBefore I do, I'd like to make sure\nmy Ditto is in good hands.\pIf you know anyone who's skilled at\nbattling, could you let me know?\pA win streak of[.] 5 at any battle\nfacility should do it.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_MasudaDittoTrader_TradeOffer
Oh! You've done it?\pYou're just the kind of trainer I've\nbeen looking for!\pWould you be willing to trade a\n[GREEN]Rotom-Heat[BLUE] for my Ditto?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Junichi_Declined
Ah, I understand. I'll put my camping\ndreams on hold for now.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Junichi_WrongPokemon
I appreciate the offer, but I'm\nreally looking for a [GREEN]Rotom-Heat[BLUE].\pThat little fella will help me get my\ncamping dreams started.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Junichi_InitiatingTrade
Alright, let's trade!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Junichi_TradeComplete
Take good care of Junichi for me.\nHe has great genes!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WonderPick_PromptFirst
I'm running a Wonder Pick promotion!\pIn exchange for some Pok\eChips, I'll\ntake a secret Pok\emon from the\lFrontier's collection to give you.\pThe first pick of the day is only\n[BUFFER2] Pok\eChips.\pWill you take the chance?\n[BLACK](Held: [BUFFER1])[BLUE]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WonderPick_PromptRepeat
Welcome back!\pYou've pulled a Pok\emon today\nalready, so the next pick would\lcost [BUFFER2] Pok\eChips.\pStill want to take the chance?\n[BLACK](Held: [BUFFER1])[BLUE]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WonderPick_Picking
Alright, let me just grab a Pok\e\nBall here[.]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WonderPick_Obtained
[BLACK][PLAYER] picked a [GREEN][BUFFER1][BLACK]!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WonderPick_Outro
[BLUE]Congratulations!\nIt's battle-ready and raring to go.\pPlease return if you'd like to\nparticipate in another Wonder Pick.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WonderPick_Declined
Not feeling luck today?\nThat's no problem!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WonderPick_NotEnoughPokeChips
This pick costs [BUFFER2] Pok\eChips,\nand you're a little short.\pWin a few more battles, then come\nback and see me.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WonderPick_NoPartyRoom
You need to make some room in your\nparty before you can Wonder Pick!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_WonderPick_Failed
I-Impossible! The collection is\nempty? That's an embarrassment!\pPlease, take your Pok\eChips and let\nus not speak of this ever again.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_MoveTutor_Confirmation
Welcome, welcome!\pI teach Pok\emon incredible moves in\nexchange for just 5 Pok\eChips.\pAre you interested?\n[BLACK](Held: [BUFFER1])

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_MoveTutor_ConfirmationAccepted
Great! What can I teach you?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_MoveTutor_Complete
All done; your Pok\emon is a quick\nlearner!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_MoveTutor_Rejected
No? Well that's a shame!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_MoveTutor_NotEnoughPokeChips
Oh dear[.] You don't have enough\nPok\eChips for my tutelage!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_BattleItems_Intro
I'm selling battle-ready items.\nCan I interest you in anything?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_BattleItems_Outro
Come again!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ZCrystals_Intro
I've smuggled some incredible Z-\nCrystals from Alola. Want some?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ZCrystals_Outro
Use them to dominate your opponents\nin battle[.]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SpecialItems_Intro
I sell one-of-a-kind items that your\nPok\emon will just love!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SpecialItems_Outro
I hope to see you again soon!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_RelicSellerIntro
Hey, you look like a smart kid.\pI have a rare treasure ethically\nsourced from a ruin in Unova.\pIt could be yours, for 2 Pok\eChips[.]\n[BLACK](Held: [BUFFER1])[BLUE]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_RelicSellerNotEnoughChips
What gives? You don't even have\nenough Pok\eChips! Your loss!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_RelicSellerChoseYes
Smart choice. Now, take this and\ndon't ask too many questions.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_RelicSellerLeavingForTheDay
If you come back tomorrow, we might\nbe able to scratch each others'\lbacks again, capiche?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_RelicSellerChoseNo
Feh, I'm not running a charity!\nScram!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_MarketGirl
I'm preparing for my next challenge\nat the market.\pNow, let's see[.] Which moves should I\nteach my Incineroar[.]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SE_Blackbelt
I need to buff up my Pok\emon's stats\nor I'm never gonna get a win!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Captain_TsarvosaCityPrompt
Well I'll be, it's Champion [PLAYER]!\pFind yourself missing the Kulurian\nmainland and want to return?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Captain_TsarvosaCityYes
Understood! Please come aboard and\nwe'll set off momentarily.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Captain_TsarvosaCityNo
Very well. We'll wait here for you,\nin case you change your mind.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_Captain_InBattleFrontierSandbox
Welcome to the Battle Frontier\nSandbox! Enjoy your stay.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_TowerBoy
The Battle Tower is a pretty simple\nfacility, all things considered.\pThat doesn't mean it's boring,\nthough!\pSometimes a traditional Pok\emon\nbattle is just what the doctor\lordered.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_TowerChild
Mom said I can watch the battles on\nthe TV! Yaay!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_TowerRocker
Ugh. I've been training for months\nand I still can't get past a streak\lof 3 wins.\pMaybe I should just throw in the\ntowel[.]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_QuarryHiker
We work in this quarry when battles\naren't happening.\pWe don't mind though - watching the\nbattles is a nice break!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_QuarryBlackbelt
Battles at the Quarry disable 2 of\n4 moveslots each turn.\pI just lost a battle because all my\ndamaging moves were disabled.\pI guess I should've brought a more\ndiverse moveset[.]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_NWOldWoman
I spend all day watching the\nbattles at the various facilities.\pBeing retired has it's perks!\nOhohoho!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_NWBoy
Do you think the Pok\emon ever get\nconfused when deciding which move\lto use at the Battle Sands?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_NWFisherman
I feel really proud when I see my\nPok\emon performing well at the\lSands.\pIt's like I can see our training\npaying off, right before my eyes.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_NWFatGuy
Oh, bother[.] This isn't the Battle\nMaz.\pI think I'll just wait for my friends\nto find me.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_NEOldMan
The battles here remind me of how\nthings used to be when I was a\lboy.\pIt's fun! The younger generation just\nneeds to open their minds to it.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_NEFisherman
Do you see that tower to the west?\pI wonder how hard it would be to\nfish off the top of it[.]

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_NELittleBoy
My Gyarados felt weaker at the\nBattle Isle.\pI don't get it! Isn't Waterfall the\nstrongest move ever?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_NEBoy
The Battle Maze is interesting.\pYou can't prep anything beforehand,\nbut that also kind of makes it\lexciting, you know?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_NEBugCatcher
It's wonderful how many flowers can\ngrow here.\pI would have thought they'd die out,\nwith how much foot traffic there\lis.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SEPsychic
I lost at the Battle Factory, but\nthat's fine.\pI'll just use my psycic powers to\nsummon better options next time!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SEChanneler
The spirit of battle is strong here.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SEWoman
Do you think anyone has ever\nconquered every facility here?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SEAceTrainer
Many trainers new to the Battle\nFrontier like to visit the Battle\lFactory and Battle Maze first.\pThose facilities let you borrow\nPok\emon, so you can rack up\lPok\eChips while you strengthen your\lown Pok\emon.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SimPicknicker
The Battle Sim causes random effects\nto trigger in each battle.\pI heard that the higher your streak\nis, the more effects there are.\pThat'll make battles pretty tough,\nwon't it..?

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SimScientist
The Battle Sim is the pride and joy\nof many researchers at the\lBattle Frontier.\pIt took years of hard work to build\nthe simulation systems you will see.\pOf course, the data we can extract\nfrom battlers is invaluable to us.\pPlease, enjoy the facility to it's\nfullest.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SimSuperNerd
Ehehehe[.] The Battle Sim is so\ndynamic.\pPerfect for a Pok\emon battling\nprodigee like me!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_FactoryWorker
You can swap one Pok\emon with your\nopponent after you win.\pThat helps you build the perfect\nteam as your streak grows.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_FactoryFatGuy
My kids love battling here because\nthey can rent battle-ready\lPok\emon.\pIt's the perfect facility for anyone\nnew to the Battle Frontier!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ObservatoryGirl
The Battle Observatory's ruleset\nleads to very fast battles.\pIt's great if you need to earn\nPok\eChips quickly!\pIt's also very punishing, if your\nopponent out-predicts you.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ObservatoryGentleman
The Battle Observatory is such an\nexciting facility.\pI like to pretend I'm a samurai\nchallenging my opponent to a duel.\pOh! Pretend you didn't hear that.

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_ObservatoryCamper
If I bring electric types, my\nopponent is more likely to bring\lground types to counter that.\pSo, I'll predict their prediction,\nand choose a water type instead!\pI'm playing both sides, so I always\ncome out on top!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_BattleTowerSign
Battle Tower\nClassic battles happen here!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_BattleQuarrySign
Battle Quarry\nMoves lock out each turn!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_BattleSandsSign
Battle Sands\nPok\emon battle independently!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_BattleIsleSign
Battle Isle\nNo items/abilities, classic moves!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_BattleMazeSign
Battle Maze\nA new, random team each battle!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SE_BattleSimSign
Battle Sim\nEach battle has random effects!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_SE_BattleFrontierMarketSign
Battle Frontier Market\nPrepare for your next win streak!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_BattleFactorySign
Battle Factory\nRent Pok\emon to battle with!

#org @gText_BattleFrontier_BattleObservatorySign
Battle Observatory\nReveal Pok\emon then showdown!

